  "body": "MACLEANS COLLEGE | BUCKLANDS BEACH INTERMEDIATE | BUCKLANDS BEACH PRIMARY SCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nA corner position. A fresh beginning. A home to make your own.\r\n\r\nThere is something appealing about a home with its own distinctive position, and 45A Hattaway Avenue offers just that.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new corner home combines contemporary design with the comfort and convenience of modern living.\r\n\r\nStep inside to an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, with access to a private, fenced courtyard — a welcoming place for morning coffee, relaxed evenings or simply enjoying time outdoors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n• Title and CCC issued\r\n• Corner position within the development\r\n•  Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n•  Contemporary open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n•  Internal-access single garage\r\n•  Private, fenced courtyard\r\n•  Modern exterior detailing\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of Bucklands Beach, with local amenities, waterfront destinations and established schooling nearby.\r\n\r\nA distinctive position and the appeal of a brand-new home.",
